          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-2-3-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Adieu! tears exhibit my tongue, most beautiful pagan, most sweet Jew! If a Christian do not play the knave and get thee, I am much deceived. But, adieu! These foolish drops do something drown my manly spirit. Adieu!",
          "plainText": "Adieu tears exhibit my tongue most beautiful pagan most sweet Jew If a Christian do not play the knave and get thee I am much deceived But adieu These foolish drops do something drown my manly spirit Adieu",
          "lineType": "prose",
